  "content": "<style>\nbody {\n    font-family: 'Jost', sans-serif;\n    color: black;\n    text-align: justify;\n    word-wrap: break-word;\n}\n\n.title {\n    font-weight: 700;\n    font-size: 35px;\n    line-height: 39px;\n    text-align: left;\n    width: 80%;\n    margin: 2em auto;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n}\n\n.h2 {\n    font-weight: 500;\n    font-size: 20px;\n    line-height: 30px;\n    margin-bottom: 2em;\n}\n\n.h3 {\n    font-family: 'Jost', sans-serif;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    font-size: 16px;\n    line-height: 30px;\n    margin-bottom: 0.5em;\n}\n\n.p {\n    font-family: 'Jost', sans-serif;\n    font-weight: 400;\n    font-size: 16px;\n    line-height: 24px;\n    margin-bottom: 2em;\n}\n\n.bold {\n    font-weight: 600;\n}\n\n.section {\n    margin-top: 30px;    \n    margin-bottom: 30px;\n}\n\n.responsive-img {\n    max-width: 100%;\n    height: auto;\n    max-height: 450px;\n    display: block;\n    margin: auto;\n    margin-bottom: 2em;\n}\n\n.container {\n    width: 80%;\n    margin: auto;\n}\n\n.content-section {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n}\n\n.content-section .text-content {\n    flex: 1;\n    padding-right: 5%;\n}\n\n.content-section .image-content {\n    flex: 1;\n}\n\n.content-section img {\n    width: 100%;\n    height: auto;\n    max-height: 320px;\n}\n.mobile-img {\n    display: none;\n}\n@media screen and (max-width: 768px) { /* this is for screens smaller than 768px wide */\n    .content-section {\n        flex-direction: column-reverse;\n    }\n    .desktop-img {\n        display: none;\n    }\n    .mobile-img {\n        display: block;\n    }\n}\n</style>\n<div class=\"container\"><img src=\"https://cdn.staticsoe.com/uploads/47711/cart/resources/20230621/5c8543ab1f549bb87a123bdf401b28f7.png\" class=\"responsive-img desktop-img\" /> <img src=\"https://cdn.staticsoe.com/uploads/47711/cart/resources/20230621/4afdda3c75499f5bcccc5f1d255a2686.jpg\" class=\"responsive-img mobile-img\" />\n<h2 class=\"h2\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">At MOMUTO, we unite customer insights with our expertise to fuel innovation. Your experiences and perspectives inspire us, helping shape our soccer kits. It's more than listening&mdash;it's collaborating to create better products.</font></font></font></font></h2>\n<h2 class=\"h3\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">YOUR VOICE MATTERS</font></font></font></font></h2>\n<p class=\"p\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Every idea you share with us is a step toward enhancing our services and products. Have a new idea for a feature? Or a unique design concept? We're excited to hear it. Each of your submissions is reviewed with care by our expert team. Your input can help shape the future of our soccer kits, enhancing the experience for all our customers.</font></font></p>\n<h2 class=\"h3\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">SUBMIT YOUR IDEAS</font></font></font></font></h2>\n<p class=\"p\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">Share your vision with us! To submit your ideas, suggestions, or design concepts, please email us at </font></font><a href=\"mailto:ideas@momuto.com\"><strong><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">ideas@momuto.com</font></font></strong></a><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\"><font style=\"vertical-align: inherit;\">. Together, let's redefine soccer fashion!</font></font></p>\n</div>",
